arbeitnow:engineering-manager-server-dri:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an Engineering Manager to lead Codeless, our internal Server-Driven UI (SDUI) platform team. In this role, you will lead a cross-functional team bridging mobile/web frontend engineering and core platform backend systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While this role is deeply rooted in modern UI architecture, its mission goes beyond standard UI development: Codeless empowers product teams across the organization to ship dynamic, native UI experiences dynamically from the backend—eliminating app store release bottlenecks, dramatically accelerating feature iteration, and establishing a unified UI schema across iOS, Android, and Web.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a role with broad impact, from hands-on technical guidance to championing web and mobile accessibility across the company. We're looking for a leader who excels at fostering collaboration and can confidently guide a concept from initial idea to robust implementation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day-to-day in this role you’ll:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Strategy: &lt;/strong&gt;Build, mentor, and scale an engineering team responsible for our core Server-Driven UI platform ("Codeless"). Foster an inclusive, high-ownership engineering culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Architecture &amp;amp; Evolution:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee the design and evolution of dynamic layout engines, declarative UI schemas, and client rendering frameworks across iOS, Android, and Web.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Developer Velocity &amp;amp; Platform Adoption:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with product feature teams to drive internal adoption of Codeless. Ensure the platform provides exceptional Developer Experience, clear tooling, robust design system integration, and seamless debugging workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Execution &amp;amp; Quality:&lt;/strong&gt; Set high technical standards for platform performance, payload optimization, caching strategies, backward compatibility, and graceful offline/fallback behavior across client devices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with Product Managers, Design System leaders, and Core Infrastructure engineers to align the Codeless roadmap with broader company initiatives and global design paradigms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll need to thrive&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Management:&lt;/strong&gt; 3+ years of experience managing software engineering teams, with a track record of coaching engineers, delivering complex platform initiatives, and driving technical strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;UI &amp;amp; Platform Domain Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong foundational background in mobile (iOS/Android) or modern web architecture (React, SwiftUI, Jetpack Compose, or declarative UI paradigms).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product &amp;amp; Platform Mindset:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Ability to treat internal product engineering teams as customers, evaluating platform success through developer velocity, adoption metrics, and rendering performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why join us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters—solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔧 Solve meaningful problems at real scale Work on a complex, always-on marketplace that impacts millions every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌱 See your impact, fast Ship, test and improve ideas quickly in a low-hierarchy, high-ownership environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 Grow through challenge and ownership Take on big, ambiguous problems and accelerate your career with strong support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 A culture built for builders High standards, collaboration, flexible working and continuous learning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 Share in the success you help create Competitive salary and equity options, so you’re rewarded for the impact you make.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➡️ Want a deeper look at how we build? Check out our Tech Blog.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Explore our Engineering Interview Guide here to help you feel confident at each stage.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark="true"&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands' legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class="_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1" href="http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness" data-renderer-mark="true" data-is-router-link="false" data-testid="link-with-safety"&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark="true"&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark="true"&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:software-engineer-research-par:
&lt;div class="flex max-w-full flex-col grow"&gt;
&lt;div class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;amp;]:mt-1" data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="f299b106-f5ab-4bce-90c8-cf18e84f4803" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-2-thinking"&gt;
&lt;div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"&gt;
&lt;div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling"&gt;
&lt;h2 style="text-align: center;"&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software Engineer - Research Participants - United Kingdom&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 style="text-align: center;" data-start="26" data-end="43"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4 style="text-align: center;" data-start="26" data-end="43"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p data-start="45" data-end="169"&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/em&gt;Remote (UK)&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Type of contract:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/em&gt;Freelance&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hourly Rate:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/em&gt;£19 (pay based on actual study time)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 style="text-align: center;" data-start="26" data-end="43"&gt;&lt;em&gt;About Prolific&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p data-start="45" data-end="169"&gt;Prolific is not just another player in the AI space – we are building the biggest pool of quality human data in the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="171" data-end="344"&gt;Over 35,000 AI developers, researchers, and organizations use Prolific to gather data from paid study participants with a wide variety of experiences, knowledge, and skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Do you have a device with a microphone? Get paid to take part in voice interviews. We’re inviting software engineers and developers based in the UK to take part in a research study run by an institution focused on global policy change. This is a paid research participation opportunity, not a job as a software engineer. Quick signup, flexible schedule, real payouts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your voice can help build a picture of how people across the UK think and talk about important issues, and that evidence is designed to inform real policy decisions. Every participant counts, and together we’re working toward a shared research goal.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The project launches in about one week, and places are allocated on a first come, first served basis, so please sign up as soon as you can.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking part in a short voice conversation with another participant&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Completing a short online survey sharing your views and experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Giving honest, considered responses based on your own perspective&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Watching the community research goal progress as more participants take part&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Residence in the UK&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A device with a working microphone&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;No research experience or specialist research qualifications required. We want a genuine cross-section of the UK population.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join this project?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;This is a chance to be part of something meaningful and have a say in research aimed at shaping policy. Once the findings are published, we’ll share them with participants so you can see the impact of your contribution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note that you must be new to Prolific to sign up successfully. If you already have a Prolific account, there is no need to register again. Simply ensure your profile is up to date to be eligible for this and future opportunities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 style="text-align: center;" data-start="2302" data-end="2362"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Why Prolific is a great platform to join as a Participant&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p data-start="2364" data-end="2679"&gt;Joining our platform as a Prolific participant will give you the chance to influence the AI models of the future using your professional expertise. Once you pass our assessment, you can join Prolific in just 15 minutes, and start enjoying competitive pay rates, flexible hours, and the ability to work from home.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="2681" data-end="2975"&gt;We've built a unique platform that connects researchers and companies with a global pool of participants, enabling the collection of high-quality, ethically sourced human behavioural data and feedback. This data is the cornerstone of developing more accurate, nuanced, and aligned AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="2977" data-end="3349"&gt;We believe that the next leap in AI capabilities won't come solely from scaling existing models, but from integrating diverse human perspectives and behaviours into AI development. By providing this crucial human data infrastructure, Prolific is positioning itself at the forefront of the next wave of AI innovation – one that reflects the breadth and the best of humanity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 style="text-align: center;" data-start="3351" data-end="3391"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Links to more information on Prolific&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center;" data-start="3393" data-end="3402"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.prolific.com/"&gt;Website&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center;" data-start="3404" data-end="3413"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/@JoinProlific"&gt;Youtube&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 style="text-align: center;" data-start="3415" data-end="3435"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Privacy Statement&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p data-start="3437" data-end="3863" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node=""&gt;By submitting your application, you agree that Prolific may collect your personal data for recruiting and global organisation planning. Prolific's&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://www.notion.so/prolific/Policy-Privacy-Notice-for-Candidates-f94a136a67544388b4888bc436451b57"&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;explains what personal information Prolific may process, where Prolific may process your personal information, its purposes for processing your personal information, and the rights you can exercise over Prolific use of your personal personal information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:data-engineer-hatfield-359118:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/bY0nNPT75xY" width="560" height="314"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Engineer (Modelling &amp;amp; Transformation)| Hybrid Working | Hatfield&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="2"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Introduction:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="2"&gt;We are Ocado Group, and we're bringing world-class automation to online grocery. Our Ocado Smart Platform (OSP) combines cutting-edge robotics, AI, and IoT within our advanced CFCs (Customer Fulfilment Centres). We've mastered the single pick, transforming online delivery for our global partners. Join us and be part of a team pushing the boundaries of retail technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id="p-rc_ed609c6a5ee7893e-248" data-path-to-node="3"&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="3,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="3,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="3"&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="3,0"&gt;As a Data Engineer within our Data Engineering Modelling and Transformation team, you will be directly responsible for building and maintaining the foundational data warehouse that powers analytics, reporting, machine learning, and partner data products across Ocado Technology&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="3,1"&gt;&lt;sup class="superscript"&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="3,2"&gt;. In this role, you will transform raw operational data into trusted, governed, and business-ready datasets that drive strategic and operational decision-making across the entire organisation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="3,3"&gt;&lt;sup class="superscript"&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="3,4"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id="p-rc_ed609c6a5ee7893e-249" data-path-to-node="4"&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="4,0"&gt;Working in an agile environment, you will collaborate closely with data scientists, analysts, product owners, and platform engineers to deliver high-quality data feeds and scalable transformation frameworks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="4,1"&gt;&lt;sup class="superscript"&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="4,2"&gt;. You will focus on designing reliable ELT/ETL pipelines, establishing rigorous data quality controls, and optimizing performance across our cloud data warehouse infrastructure to ensure seamless downstream data delivery for all enterprise consumers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="4,3"&gt;&lt;sup class="superscript"&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="4,4"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="5"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node="6"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id="p-rc_ed609c6a5ee7893e-250" data-path-to-node="6,0,0"&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="6,0,0,0"&gt;Responsible for building and maintaining the core data warehouse that powers analytics, reporting, machine learning, and partner data products&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="6,0,0,1"&gt;&lt;sup class="superscript"&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="6,0,0,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id="p-rc_ed609c6a5ee7893e-251" data-path-to-node="6,1,0"&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="6,1,0,0"&gt;Design, develop, and maintain scalable, reliable ELT/ETL pipelines across enterprise data solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="6,1,0,1"&gt;&lt;sup class="superscript"&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="6,1,0,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id="p-rc_ed609c6a5ee7893e-252" data-path-to-node="6,2,0"&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="6,2,0,0"&gt;Build and optimise dimensional and analytical data models to meet complex business reporting and analytics needs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="6,2,0,1"&gt;&lt;sup class="superscript"&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="6,2,0,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id="p-rc_ed609c6a5ee7893e-253" data-path-to-node="6,3,0"&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="6,3,0,0"&gt;Develop and maintain reusable data transformation logic using modern software engineering best practices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="6,3,0,1"&gt;&lt;sup class="superscript"&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="6,3,0,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id="p-rc_ed609c6a5ee7893e-254" data-path-to-node="6,4,0"&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="6,4,0,0"&gt;Implement automated data quality checks, pipeline monitoring, and testing frameworks to ensure data reliability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="6,4,0,1"&gt;&lt;sup class="superscript"&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="6,4,0,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id="p-rc_ed609c6a5ee7893e-255" data-path-to-node="6,5,0"&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="6,5,0,0"&gt;Collaborate with analysts, data scientists, product teams, and platform engineers to deliver secure, business-ready datasets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="6,5,0,1"&gt;&lt;sup class="superscript"&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="6,5,0,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id="p-rc_ed609c6a5ee7893e-256" data-path-to-node="6,6,0"&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="6,6,0,0"&gt;Monitor, troubleshoot, and optimise pipeline performance to continuously improve efficiency and operational resilience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="6,6,0,1"&gt;&lt;sup class="superscript"&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="6,6,0,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id="p-rc_ed609c6a5ee7893e-257" data-path-to-node="6,7,0"&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="6,7,0,0"&gt;Participate in code reviews and actively contribute to continuous improvements in team engineering standards&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="6,7,0,1"&gt;&lt;sup class="superscript"&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="6,7,0,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id="p-rc_ed609c6a5ee7893e-258" data-path-to-node="6,8,0"&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="6,8,0,0"&gt;Produce clear documentation and foster knowledge sharing across the data engineering craft&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="6,8,0,1"&gt;&lt;sup class="superscript"&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="6,8,0,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="7"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="7" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;What We’re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="8"&gt;&lt;em data-path-to-node="8" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Essential&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node="9"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id="p-rc_ed609c6a5ee7893e-259" data-path-to-node="9,0,0"&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="9,0,0,0"&gt;Proven experience developing ELT/ETL pipelines and working with data transformation frameworks such as dbt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="9,0,0,1"&gt;&lt;sup class="superscript"&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="9,0,0,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id="p-rc_ed609c6a5ee7893e-260" data-path-to-node="9,1,0"&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="9,1,0,0"&gt;Strong SQL skills and a solid understanding of programming fundamentals in Python, SQL, or standard query languages&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="9,1,0,1"&gt;&lt;sup class="superscript"&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="9,1,0,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id="p-rc_ed609c6a5ee7893e-261" data-path-to-node="9,2,0"&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="9,2,0,0"&gt;Hands-on experience using Git and CI/CD workflows&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="9,2,0,1"&gt;&lt;sup class="superscript"&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="9,2,0,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id="p-rc_ed609c6a5ee7893e-262" data-path-to-node="9,3,0"&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="9,3,0,0"&gt;Strong analytical, problem-solving, and clear communication skills with a collaborative mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="9,3,0,1"&gt;&lt;sup class="superscript"&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="9,3,0,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id="p-rc_ed609c6a5ee7893e-263" data-path-to-node="9,4,0"&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="9,4,0,0"&gt;Degree in Computer Science, Data Science, Software Engineering, Mathematics, or equivalent practical experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="9,4,0,1"&gt;&lt;sup class="superscript"&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="9,4,0,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id="p-rc_ed609c6a5ee7893e-264" data-path-to-node="9,5,0"&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="9,5,0,0"&gt;Solid understanding of core data concepts, including data storage, transformation, and analysis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="9,5,0,1"&gt;&lt;sup class="superscript"&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="9,5,0,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
